%% The foundations of the simulator, from the architecture analysis (an estimate: it has no commit in this repository) to the last merge
%% before the gap of 2026-10-29 to 2026-11-05. Each bar is a group of related merges of the main branch (git log --first-parent), from the
%% first to the last day of the group, named by the work done. Kept by hand.
gantt
    title The simulator: foundations (25 Sep to 29 Oct 2026)
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %d %b
    tickInterval 1week
    todayMarker off

    section Design
    Architecture analysis (est.)                 :done, 2026-09-25, 2026-10-11

    section Build and CI
    One repository with the two submodules       :done, 2026-10-11, 2026-10-13
    Build system, presets, and CI                :done, 2026-10-12, 2026-10-13
    A vcpkg cache across runner images           :done, 2026-10-15, 2026-10-16
    The check of the submodule pins              :done, 2026-10-20, 2026-10-21
    A vcpkg cache that restores                  :done, 2026-10-29, 2026-10-30

    section gVirtualXRay
    The core library in the build                :done, 2026-10-14, 2026-10-15
    Its latest commit, the cheap detector        :done, 2026-10-21, 2026-10-27

    section Prototype
    The first X-ray image in the Engine's frame  :done, 2026-10-15, 2026-10-16
    The scene and its image beside the 3D view   :done, 2026-10-15, 2026-10-16
